---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
import Link from "../components/Link.astro";
import Accordion from "../components/Accordion.astro";
import HeroImage from "../assets/home/hero.jpg";
import "../styles/pages/home.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="home-page">
			<h1 class="hero-title">Hi, I'm Hrishikesh</h1>
			<p>Software Engineer building agentic AI systems in Bengaluru, India</p>

			<section class="hero-banner" aria-label="Hero banner">
				<div class="hero-banner-frame">
					<Image
						class="hero-banner-image"
						src={HeroImage}
						alt=""
						widths={[400, 750, 1100]}
						sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px"
						loading="eager"
					/>
				</div>
			</section>

			<p class="check-in">
				Thanks for checking in! I go into some ramblings and random tangents
				about myself <Link href="/about" fontWeight="semibold">here</Link>, so
				if you want to read a little bit about me, that's a good place.
			</p>

			<p>Right now, I'm mostly focused on:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>
					Building multi-agent systems with LangGraph — predictive
					maintenance, conversational commerce, and cloud cost governance
				</li>
				<li>RAG pipelines, retrieval tooling, and prompt engineering</li>
				<li>
					Backend engineering with FastAPI, and cloud work across AWS and Azure
				</li>
				<li>
					and writing up worklogs and technical notes on what I build along the
					way :)
				</li>
			</ul>

			<Accordion label="Open to interesting conversations">
				<p>
					I've spent the last few years moving from general software
					engineering into GenAI and agentic systems — building multi-agent
					pipelines with LangGraph, RAG systems, and LLM-driven automation in
					production. I'm always up for talking shop on agentic architectures,
					retrieval systems, or backend engineering more broadly.
				</p>
				<p>
					If you're working on something interesting in this space, or just
					want to compare notes on what's actually working in production
					agentic systems versus what looks good in a demo, I'd love to chat.
				</p>
				<p>
					<Link href="mailto:hrishikeshagarwalv@gmail.com" fontWeight="medium">
						Email
					</Link>
					or
					<Link
						fontWeight="medium"
						href="https://linkedin.com/in/hrishikesh-agarwal"
					>
						LinkedIn
					</Link>
					work best for me; I'll get back to you as soon as I can.
				</p>
			</Accordion>
			<p>
				You can also check out my <Link href="/blog" fontWeight="medium"
					>blog</Link
				> or <Link href="/philosophy" fontWeight="medium">philosophy</Link>
				pages for project updates and worklogs, or just throw me a message on the
				aforementioned links if you wanna chat about stuff :)
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
